      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but it's only like one small glass of wine. i'm not trying to get drunk or anything, just want to relax. i've heard people do it all the time and they're fine. is it really that dangerous if it's just a little bit? i just really need to sleep tonight because i'm exhausted.",
