      "content": "idk i feel like you're being a bit dramatic lol. i'm an adult and i know my limits. if i just have like 5oz of wine and then take my pill, what's the actual medical reason why that's a big deal? like is it actually going to stop my breathing or are you just being cautious? i really just need a straight answer so i can decide.",
